# Cloudflare / static host redirects. Prefer www as the canonical host (matches
# Vercel domain settings and sitemap). Permanent 301 so Google consolidates
# indexing signals onto https://www.lasvegasrelocationservices.com/

https://lasvegasrelocationservices.com/* https://www.lasvegasrelocationservices.com/:splat 301
http://lasvegasrelocationservices.com/* https://www.lasvegasrelocationservices.com/:splat 301

# Trailing-slash normalization
/*/ /:splat 301
